    """Resolve the canonical cache-safe metadata for one symbolic sequence.

    The schema-backed caller supplies no values or arity. Empty lists therefore
    receive the same metadata as populated lists. Typed metadata failures occur
    before grammar construction, and no runtime inference or fallback is
    permitted. The SQL grammar and terminal codec layers consume the returned
    immutable record.
